### Logout user and invalidate token
### This will blacklist the current token in Redis, preventing further use
POST http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

> {% if (response.status === 200 && response.body.success) { client.global.set("token", ""); client.global.set("refreshToken", ""); } %}
